WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.673
Freshness is one of the clearest differences among
these objects A later

00:00:05.686 --> 00:00:11.430
CTE statement uses current source data A standard
view reads through

00:00:11.457 --> 00:00:17.091
to the current underlying data A materialized view
stays at its last

00:00:17.118 --> 00:00:22.882
snapshot until refreshed Consumers should never have
to guess which freshness

00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:23.988
model they are using
